  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Scope",
      "gridPos": {
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Application owner view** \u2014 which synthetic origin (cms / gateway) is under pressure or disconnected (orange annotations), and the synthetic retail families and locales it served. All family/locale series are **origin completions from all callers**, not client or cache traffic; they carry no origin label, so the origin filter applies only to the origin panels. LOCAL synthetic test traffic only, combined across every LOCAL acceptance run in the selected window (not one acceptance run, not production). Every counter is rated per series before summing; current-value series are kept only while their own scrape target reports up == 1. Absent data means unknown or not exercised, never a healthy zero."
      },
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Origin availability and pressure (all callers)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "id": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Origin scrape health",
      "description": "1 = last scrape succeeded, 0 = registered target failing (kept while any target of its run is up). LOCAL synthetic test traffic only, combined across every LOCAL acceptance run in the selected window (not one acceptance run, not production). Every counter is rated per series before summing; current-value series are kept only while their own scrape target reports up == 1. Absent data means unknown or not exercised, never a healthy zero.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "local-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "w": 12,
        "h": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "No data: unknown / not exercised / no live target \u2014 never a healthy zero",
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "gray"
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "OK",
                  "color": "green"
                },
                "0": {
                  "text": "Error",
                  "color": "red"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "null+nan",
                "result": {
                  "text": "Offline / Unknown",
                  "color": "gray"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "gray",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "last"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "renameByRegex",
          "options": {
            "regex": "skipper-a:9911",
            "renamePattern": "Skipper A"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "renameByRegex",
          "options": {
            "regex": "skipper-b:9911",
            "renamePattern": "Skipper B"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "renameByRegex",
          "options": {
            "regex": "\\bcatalogs\\b",
            "renamePattern": "Catalogs"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "renameByRegex",
          "options": {
            "regex": "\\bapi\\b",
            "renamePattern": "Content gateway"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "renameByRegex",
          "options": {
            "regex": "\\bfooter\\b",
            "renamePattern": "Retail footer"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "renameByRegex",
          "options": {
            "regex": "mock:9091",
            "renamePattern": "Mock origins"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "renameByRegex",
          "options": {
            "regex": "^cms( |$)",
            "renamePattern": "CMS HTTPS$1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "renameByRegex",
          "options": {
            "regex": "^gateway( |$)",
            "renamePattern": "Content gateway HTTP$1"
          }
        }
      ],
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "local-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "min by (instance) (up{job=\"mock-origin\"} and on (run_id) (max by (run_id) (up{job=~\"skipper-local|mock-origin\"}) == 1))",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Origin request rate by origin",
      "description": "Aggregate origin, ALL callers (nginx, Skipper A and B, background refresh): the mock origin cannot attribute requests to a caller, so this is an adjacent context panel, not a Skipper-only overlay. LOCAL synthetic test traffic only, combined across every LOCAL acceptance run in the selected window (not one acceptance run, not production). Every counter is rated per series before summing; current-value series are kept only while their own scrape target reports up == 1. Absent data means unknown or not exercised, never a healthy zero.",
